&lt;li&gt;A bachelor&#39;s degree or 3+ years commensurate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of work experience in process management, process improvement or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional experience in provider data or provider network operations within a health insurance company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience using process management methodologies, such as Lean Six Sigma, BPMN, or similar frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience with end to end process management and mapping&lt;/li&gt;
