&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors Degree or 4+ years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in provider healthcare recruiting and contracting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years experience in provider relations, provider services or provider recruiting, and working cross-functionally to drive growth and expansion in one or more geographical areas&lt;/li&gt;
