&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Economics, Business Administration, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive experience in analytical financial roles, with significant leadership responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of demonstrated ability using expert financial modeling skills to effectively translate complex data into actionable insights, robust strategies, and comprehensive financial plans, particularly in a corporate development context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of significant corporate development experience, including direct involvement in M&amp;amp;A financial modeling, valuation, and negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience collaborating, influencing, and presenting at the executive level, including direct interaction with C-suite and Board members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
