&lt;li&gt;6 or more years of experience in health care strategy, consulting, insurance product, market strategy or related functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting ACA/QHP health insurance markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading programs within a matrixed organization&lt;/li&gt;
