&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of progressive experience in healthcare revenue cycle, professional billing, coding, or related healthcare operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience leading revenue cycle programs, teams, or functions with accountability for operational and/or financial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of professional billing and coding, including CPT, ICD-10-CM, HCPCS, modifiers, CCI/NCCI edits, claims management, denial management, and payer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
