&lt;li&gt;Be a culture carrier, driving engagement with your team by creating an inclusive and inviting culture that aligns with Oscar&#39;s core values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively lead and participate in continuous improvement activities that drive or influence the improvement and development of a high performing production team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and closing gaps on existing operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively across production and other Oscar teams to implement best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
