&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience in a customer service environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ year of direct people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience using data and metrics to drive improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience working with teams in multiple locations and multiple disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
